I come back home.
I change my clothes.
I put on comfortable clothes.
Now I go into my kitchen.
I am making dinner.
Today I am making a very simple meal.
I am chopping fresh vegetables.
I am also boiling rice.
I take out my new masala dabba.
It is made of steel.
There are many different spices in it.
I am adding some spices to the vegetables.
A good smell is coming from the food.
My kitchen is completely quiet.
I am feeling very at ease here.
Now my food is ready.
I am eating my food peacefully.
